<h2>Use of the site</h2>
<p>
  The materials on this site inform about the activities of DECOBROSCREW, its training, expeditions
  and club events.
</p>
<p>
  Information on the site is not in itself a contract, a public offer or a guarantee that a specific
  program, expedition place or service is available, unless expressly stated otherwise.
</p>

<h2>Training</h2>
<p>
  Participant requirements, program content, duration, conditions and the possibility of
  certification depend on the specific course, the participant’s qualifications, the instructor, the
  dive conditions and the applicable standards of the training agency.
</p>
<p>
  Information on the site does not replace an individual assessment of a participant’s readiness.
</p>

<h2>Expeditions</h2>
<p>
  Routes, dive programs and schedules may change because of weather, sea conditions, logistics,
  requirements of the host and safety decisions.
</p>

<h2>Safety</h2>
<p>Diving involves inherent risks.</p>
<p>
  Participants must follow the requirements of the specific program, the instructions of the staff,
  medical restrictions and the applicable safety rules.
</p>

